0/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/alive-and-unwell-2008-09-23","license":null,"text":"\"Alive and Unwell\". Savor the Flavor, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Sep 2008. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"savor-flavor-alive-and-unwell-2008-09-23-e3","era":null,"summary":"Sedris massacred his family and advisors in a bloody ritual to continue his consciousness as a lich; the knights who failed to stop him died with the word grixis on their tongues.","participants":["sedris","vithia"],"location":"vithia","importance":"major","page":"archive/savor-flavor-alive-and-unwell-2008-09-23","order":154,"story_date":"2008-09-23","storyline":"Shards of Alara","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":12,"quote":"Sedris massacred all of his family and close advisors to fuel the bloody ritual that would ensure the continuation of his consciousness into unlife.","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20210902054830/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/alive-and-unwell-2008-09-23#:~:text=Sedris%20massacred%20all%20of,his%20consciousness%20into%20unlife.","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Alive and Unwell","series":"Savor the Flavor","authors":[],"date":"2008-09-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/alive-and-unwell-2008-09-23","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20210902054830/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/alive-and-unwell-2008-09-23#:~:text=Sedris%20massacred%20all%20of,his%20consciousness%20into%20unlife.","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20210902054830/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/alive-and-unwell-2008-09-23","license":null,"text":"\"Alive and Unwell\". Savor the Flavor, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Sep 2008. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"savor-flavor-alive-and-unwell-2008-09-23-e4","era":null,"summary":"The kingdom flooded with demons and undead, the capital fell and 