 Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"savor-flavor-encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21-e12","era":null,"summary":"Eliza drops the spell and collapses, then sends the scout to follow Sedris with the twin necklace to find his lair, declaring herself baron of Unx.","participants":["eliza","kathari-scout","sedris","unx"],"location":"unx","importance":"major","page":"archive/savor-flavor-encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21","order":159,"story_date":"2008-10-21","storyline":"Shards of Alara","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":59,"quote":"I'm the baron of Unx now.","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211208103941/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21#:~:text=I%27m%20the%20baron%20of%20Unx%20now.","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Encounter at the Necropolis","series":"Savor the Flavor","authors":[],"date":"2008-10-21","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211208103941/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21#:~:text=I%27m%20the%20baron%20of%20Unx%20now.","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211208103941/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21","license":null,"text":"\"Encounter at the Necropolis\". Savor the Flavor, Wizards of the Coast, 21 Oct 2008. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"eliza-e2","era":null,"summary":"Eliza stands down Sedris with a reanimated dragon.","participants":["eliza","sedris"],"location":"unx","importance":"minor","page":"wiki/eliza","order":1599,"story_date":"","storyline":"Shards of Alara","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":2,"quote":"Eliza successfully stood down Sedris","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Eliza#:~:text=Eliza%20successfully%20stood%20down%20Sedris","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":